[1m[38;5;231mHow should the shared validation module be loaded?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mES modules (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mvalidation.js exports; index.html uses <script type="module" src="app.js">. Standard, testable, no dependencies. [39m
     [38;5;246mRequires serving over HTTP instead of opening the file directly.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Global via second script tag
     [38;5;246mvalidation.js sets window.FormValidation; index.html loads it before app.js. Zero disruption, file:// keeps [39m
     [38;5;246mworking. Implicit load order, global namespace, harder to test.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Add a bundler
     [38;5;246mesbuild or Vite, with a build step. Best long-term ergonomics; introduces a toolchain and a dependency this repo [39m
     [38;5;246mhas avoided so far.[39m
